# Griffnaut Tracker (3/2 flier): "exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard" is optional in both slots. Bot2's Bolt leaves one card in its graveyard and
# Bot1's own Bolt one in Bot1's. Bot1 names only Bot2's Bolt as the first target and passes the optional second slot: that card alone is exiled and Bot1's Bolt stays.
# The Tracker has Flying and is a 3/2.

